  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Not all wars can be won on the battlefield, a lesson that many rajahs fail to learn. At 3rd level and every two levels thereafter, the rajah gains a heraldry from the following list. Unless otherwise noted, a rajah can only select an individual heraldry once. Heraldries that grant the rajah or her unseen servants spell-like abilities use the rajah’s class level as their caster level, and use the rajah’s initiation modifier to determine their saving throw DCs and the bonus the rajah and her servants use on concentration checks. Heraldries share their daily uses across all unseen servants, even if they are all dismissed and re-summoned. A list of heraldries can be found below.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/rajah#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
